    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 8 Gleann na Rí a beautifully refurbished two bedroom ground floor apartment ideally positioned within this highly regarded development.\r\n\r\nPresented to the market in excellent condition this stylish apartment has been recently refurbished throughout and offers bright well-proportioned accommodation with a warm and contemporary feel. Perfectly suited to first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike, No. 8 combines modern interiors, natural tones with an exceptionally convenient location.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of the property is its excellent transport connectivity with the LUAS at Cherrywood just a five minute walk away providing an easy commute towards Dublin City and beyond. Cherrywood has also developed into a vibrant hub offering a selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and local businesses right on the doorstep.\r\n\r\nOn entering the welcoming hallway immediately sets the tone with clever built-in storage and attractive continuous wood flooring creating a sense of space and cohesion throughout the apartment. The generously proportioned living and dining room is a bright and inviting space offering ample room for both comfortable relaxation and entertaining. A feature gas fire with surround provides a cosy focal point while access to the covered area at the front adds further versatility to this living space. The contemporary refurbished kitchen has been thoughtfully upgraded and features new kitchen units, a new worktop, sink and appliances. Under-counter lighting, tiled splash back and tiled flooring complete the finish while the additional hot press provides valuable storage.\r\n\r\nA central hallway leads through to two impressive double bedrooms both quietly positioned to the rear of the apartment. Each bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes and wood flooring providing comfortable and practical accommodation. The accommodation and viewing is concluded by a modern upgraded bathroom, incorporating a three-piece suite, electric shower over the bath and contemporary vanity mirror.\r\n\r\nExternally, No. 8 enjoys a convenient position towards the front of this established development and benefits from off-street parking for one car, with additional parking for a second vehicle available by permit. The location is one of the property's major attractions. Gleann na Rí is situated just off the M50 at Junction 16, offering excellent access to Dublin's road network and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors the nearby Dublin Mountains provide a wealth of recreational opportunities including walking trails, running routes, mountain biking and forest strolls. A selection of sporting facilities and clubs can also be found within easy reach. Everyday shopping is conveniently catered for with Tesco Express in Cherrywood while Cornelscourt and Dundrum Town Centre are both within a short drive for a wider selection of retail, dining and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front: \r\n\r\n-\tOpen and covered area, coble-locked stone, storage area \r\n\r\nHall:     \t\t\t c. 1.99 x 1.70m\r\n\r\n-\tNeat entrance hall, built-in storage, wood flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room:      \t\tc. 4.37 x 5.29m\r\n\r\n-\tWelcoming lining room, bright and airy living space, feature gas fire with surround, comfortable dining space, relaxing area, sliding doors to covered outside area, wood flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen:    \t\t c. 2.95 x 2.16m\r\n\r\n-\tSeparate kitchen, refurbished kitchen units, new sink, new counter top, built in cooking appliances, dishwasher, washer/dryer, hot press, tiled floor\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:     \t\tc.4.17 x 2.80  \t\t (to rear)\r\n\r\n-\tDouble bedroom, fitted wardrobes, wood flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:    \t\t c.4.18 x 2.38m  \t(to rear)\r\n\r\n-\t Double bedroom, fitted wardrobes, wood flooring\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom:     \t\tc. 2.15 x 1.93m\r\n\r\n-\tFully tiled, 3x piece suite, new electric shower over bath, new vanity mirror with light"
      },
